5,1,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get this sorted! Let's make sure we don't just make a plan that looks good on paper. I'll check the ""Truck arrival time from the crew leader"" and ""Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.""","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that we need a practical approach. To ensure we have a clear understanding of the current issues, I'll look into the ""Ward complaint log for this point"" and ""Statements at the residents' meeting.""","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm ready to help! I want to make sure we find a way that makes everyone happy. I'll check the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs""!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I agree that harmony is very important for our lane. I'd like to check ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" and ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" to see other examples.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our solution is sustainable and kind to everyone's spirit, I shall look into the ""Measurements of the five frontages"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes.""","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, I hope those complaint logs aren't too scary! I'm just worried we'll end up with a mountain of paperwork. Does anyone else think the ward office might make this harder than it needs to be?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the logs are simply data to help us avoid repeating past mistakes. As for the paperwork, that is why your research into the filing requirements is so important. We should let the facts guide us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, don't worry! I bet we can handle the paperwork together. I'm really curious to see how much we've been spending on the bins so far. Maybe there's a way to make it cheaper for everyone!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that is a very thoughtful way to look at it. I hope we can find a solution that is affordable and gentle on everyone. I'm looking forward to seeing if the other lanes have any helpful ideas!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my dear friends. Let us not let worry cloud our vision. By understanding the physical space and the history of others, we can build a foundation of true peace and fairness.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're so poetic! But ""true peace"" usually requires a bit of hard work. I just want to make sure we aren't accidentally signing up for a second job as ward clerks. Let's keep it simple!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Simplicity is a goal, but not at the expense of effectiveness. If we ignore the root causes of the complaints, we will only be delaying the next conflict. Let's focus on the data first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Mizuki! Let's find out the real problems first. I'm super excited to see the numbers in the ledger! I bet if we know the costs, we can make a plan that's fair for everyone!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Kenji. Knowing the costs is helpful, but I also hope we can find a way to make the process feel friendly. I want us all to feel comfortable talking to each other again.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the heart of any community is the strength of its bonds. While numbers and rules provide the structure, it is our mutual care and understanding that will truly sustain us in the long run.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"I love the optimism, but let's not get too carried away with the ""bonds"" just yet! I'm going to go hunt for those truck times and filing rules. See you all soon with the results!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will proceed with my research into the complaints and resident statements. It is essential that we understand the actual grievances before we propose a solution. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm on it! I'll go dive into the ledger and the subsidy info right now! I can't wait to see what I find. See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go and see what the other lanes are doing. I hope we can find a way to make everyone feel happy and welcome again. I'll see you all in the next round!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I shall now begin my research. Let us each seek the truth in the data, and return with a spirit of openness. I look forward to our next gathering. Until then, be well.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
